Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,worked,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Worked on the series:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Singer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,name,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:06.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,All characters are fictitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.52,0:01:08.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and the events shown are fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.19,0:02:21.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.23,0:02:26.10,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,A real miracle for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:28.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,that after every day tomorrow comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:32.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is dangerous. There may be another explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:36.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.91,0:02:38.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,No. You can't go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.81,0:02:41.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.55,0:02:43.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Protect the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.98,0:02:46.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:50.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, we need to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:52.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:02.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,No. We need to save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.90,0:03:05.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Don’t go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:06.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don’t interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.61,0:03:08.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What are you saying? King...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.91,0:03:10.21,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:14.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll explain everything to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:16.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Now save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.52,0:03:18.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-It’s dangerous here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:20.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,take the queen to Daejojeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:24.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty, don’t go there.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.39,0:03:25.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Let me in!\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.99,0:03:27.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.69,0:03:29.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let me in, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.60,0:03:31.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:32.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.97,0:03:34.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.73,0:03:36.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,However
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:39.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,we don’t understand how wonderful it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.91,0:03:43.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,until the day comes that has no tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:48.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We are so stupid that we don’t value something,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.98,0:03:50.68,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,until we lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.05,0:03:57.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Tomorrow never comes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.63,0:04:02.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,13 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.17,0:04:18.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Someone dared to assassinate the king in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:22.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Catch all suspicious persons and interrogate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.68,0:04:24.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We have to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:27.19,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,who is behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.02,0:04:31.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Have you prepared this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:35.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How are you going to deal with the consequences after planning this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:36.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:39.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,As if I could calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.13,0:04:41.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The king's life was threatened in front of everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.90,0:04:43.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,also for show.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:48.81,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,So, everyone decided that I was the one who attempted on his life?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:53.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.39,0:05:03.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I beg you. I pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:07.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I desperately pray to the gods of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.13,0:05:12.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Save our king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.93,0:05:17.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I beg you. I pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.57,0:05:19.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.81,0:05:24.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Save
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.25,0:05:28.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,our king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:36.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I didn't know they'd go this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:39.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,They themselves placed him on the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:42.43,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,and now they want to get rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.06,0:05:48.10,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What happens if the king does not wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.07,0:05:55.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Then the royal concubine and I will be powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:06:00.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I can’t believe we got it right
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.25,0:06:03.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,into a trap set for the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.05,0:06:06.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I beg you. I pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.79,0:06:10.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.89,0:06:16.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Rest a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:18.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You will fall so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.80,0:06:25.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If the king does not survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.61,0:06:28.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I won’t be able to live either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:34.01,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If you have to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.85,0:06:38.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,before I die I will take revenge on the king’s offender.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.69,0:06:41.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Palace
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:45.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and those people
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.79,0:06:50.66,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,made us angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.70,0:07:27.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. The head of the Detective Department came.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.57,0:07:31.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And Cheoljong...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:35.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Is the king okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:39.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong prohibited
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.51,0:07:41.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,enter Hijonjon while the king is being treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:45.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And they don’t say anything about the king’s condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:47.25,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I must go to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.25,0:07:48.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don’t go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.86,0:07:53.79,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,They will let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:55.26,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,I’m still his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:24.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don’t go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.79,0:08:26.96,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,He attempted on your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:30.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You have every right to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.27,0:08:39.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:52.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.94,0:09:51.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Are you sure there won’t be any problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:52.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.84,0:10:21.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Who was behind this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.48,0:10:24.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We are innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.71,0:10:27.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We are ready to give our lives to protect the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:29.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We are the royal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.49,0:10:38.29,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why do you need fake documents?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.56,0:10:41.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You used this excuse to detain us,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:44.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and at this time the king suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.23,0:10:46.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The one behind this is,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.97,0:10:49.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,who found errors in our documents. Your father
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:51.54,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Kim Jwageun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:55.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is Kim Jwageun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.21,0:10:58.71,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You're pretty smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:06.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.16,0:11:15.70,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,As you thought, the incense burner was not filled with sand,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:17.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and gunpowder used as explosives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.06,0:11:19.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How did you guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.94,0:11:29.11,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:31.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It’s not easy to force them to confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:32.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Without a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.18,0:11:34.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Did you learn anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.21,0:11:36.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.55,0:11:39.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We need to find the criminals to put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.75,0:11:41.65,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Find the instigator as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.65,0:11:42.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.19,0:11:50.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Find out where the gunpowder comes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.56,0:11:53.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Move quietly and alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:54.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.71,0:12:05.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.31,0:12:08.91,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.95,0:12:12.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Too many eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.32,0:12:14.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:16.36,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:20.19,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It won’t take much time. Just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.46,0:12:22.83,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Please. Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.33,0:12:26.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm just in case
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:30.47,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,kept the accounting book.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.24,0:12:35.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I never even thought of using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.41,0:12:39.11,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Besides, the queen knew nothing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:40.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Where is the accounting book now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.92,0:12:49.29,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Isn’t she in your possession?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.62,0:12:52.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Then she can only be
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.33,0:12:54.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,at the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.13,0:12:57.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.73,0:13:03.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The traces you left put our clan in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.57,0:13:05.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is enough to punish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.27,0:13:07.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I’ll do whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.07,0:13:09.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If you tell me to die, I will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:16.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.49,0:13:21.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll hang myself right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.39,0:13:26.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm hanging myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.43,0:13:35.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Spare me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.90,0:13:40.11,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Spare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:52.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:55.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, have you come to your senses?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:13:58.89,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.89,0:14:01.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes. Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:04.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why is it so noisy in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:08.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So noisy it gives me a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.80,0:14:12.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I can’t hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.97,0:14:16.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mute the noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.76,0:14:35.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I should have explained.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.30,0:14:40.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I should have told him that the king did not try to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:45.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,He attempted on your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.37,0:14:47.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You have every right to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:54.85,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You will have to pay for your recklessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.85,0:14:57.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Is the Kim clan behind this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:01.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Or another clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:04.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.29,0:15:09.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. The king came to his senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.69,0:15:34.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,He seems to have woken up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:37.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,He just fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.13,0:15:49.03,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why did you wrap him up like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:53.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Looks too sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.41,0:15:55.81,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.61,0:15:59.55,Default,bir,0,0,0,,due to the explosion, he lost his hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:04.18,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Don’t say it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.55,0:16:09.25,Default,bir,0,0,0,,that he will be deaf for the rest of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.52,0:16:12.46,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Only time will tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.84,0:16:29.21,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.71,0:16:31.78,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:53.77,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Will you say again that this is not the work of your kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.67,0:16:56.97,Default,bir,0,0,0,,You told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:17:00.21,Default,bir,0,0,0,,that I will lose someone who is dear to my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.14,0:17:04.64,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Now in my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.84,0:17:08.28,Default,bir,0,0,0,,no one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:13.85,Default,bir,0,0,0,,So I ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.59,0:17:16.76,Default,bir,0,0,0,,stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.78,0:17:39.65,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, stop worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.77,0:18:04.87,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Who...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.64,0:18:09.64,Default,bir,0,0,0,,My king, have you woken up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.91,0:18:12.61,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Let me wet your lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:25.86,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Queen's Dictionary
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.25,0:18:56.02,Default,bir,0,0,0,,So you went to visit the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.59,0:19:05.40,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I came to console you after what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.83,0:19:08.10,Default,bir,0,0,0,,and ask a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.04,0:19:12.94,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Your father has lost an important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.71,0:19:16.28,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I'm sure the king secretly took her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.11,0:19:18.88,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Do you know anything about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.05,0:19:22.48,Default,bir,0,0,0,,-Got it, I’m running for help.\N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:25.78,Default,bir,0,0,0,,No one should know that I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.99,0:19:29.02,Default,bir,0,0,0,,What am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.53,0:19:34.86,Default,bir,0,0,0,,So you know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.06,0:19:37.90,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Remember what I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.90,0:19:39.73,Default,bir,0,0,0,,that our kind has no weaknesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.93,0:19:42.97,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Because we get rid of them right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.18,0:19:55.08,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Let me ask you one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:58.72,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Is there anything you want to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.39,0:20:02.89,Default,bir,0,0,0,,When we were in my house,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:07.13,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I saved the king when he fell into the well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.29,0:20:09.66,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Maybe it was then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.37,0:20:18.77,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Some time ago I made you an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:21.44,Default,bir,0,0,0,,The day you fell into the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.61,0:20:26.68,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Let me remind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.85,0:20:30.58,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I asked you not to take your eyes off your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.85,0:20:33.09,Default,bir,0,0,0,,You will accept
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.45,0:20:36.76,Default,bir,0,0,0,,my suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.10,0:20:50.74,Default,bir,0,0,0,,And what will I get in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.34,0:20:52.84,Default,bir,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:56.48,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Guarantees of my safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.13,0:21:18.40,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Your Highness, it’s time for you to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.51,0:21:32.21,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Queen's Dictionary
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.27,0:21:59.94,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I shouldn’t have gotten here\NJang Bong-hwan
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.12,0:22:14.19,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Cheoljong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.15,0:22:16.25,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:19.32,Default,bir,0,0,0,,You will still lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.56,0:22:23.43,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I side with the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.94,0:22:34.41,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Kim Soyeon, you still said goodbye to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.17,0:22:38.01,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Since I already happened to take your place,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.78,0:22:40.98,Default,bir,0,0,0,,let me live this life well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.28,0:22:45.18,Default,bir,0,0,0,,In order for this to succeed, I need to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.88,0:22:47.22,Default,bir,0,0,0,,what happened that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.48,0:23:50.15,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Someday you will lose
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.25,0:23:52.78,Default,bir,0,0,0,,person dear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.02,0:23:56.12,Default,bir,0,0,0,,You must love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.12,0:23:58.16,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Is this an order?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.10,0:24:05.90,Default,bir,0,0,0,,There is nothing real about me, everything is a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.40,0:24:09.33,Default,bir,0,0,0,,You are Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.21,0:24:18.78,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Have you taken this position yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.48,0:24:21.85,Default,bir,0,0,0,,If you want to die, die in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.18,0:24:25.92,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Tomorrow you will become queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.66,0:24:38.40,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Tomorrow you will become queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.53,0:24:39.60,Default,bir,0,0,0,,From now on
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.43,0:24:43.84,Default,bir,0,0,0,,tell me all about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.97,0:24:46.34,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Ask me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.87,0:24:49.24,Default,bir,0,0,0,,watch the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.54,0:24:52.51,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Do not follow the king,\N and do not take your eyes off your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.18,0:24:58.32,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I don’t want.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.85,0:25:03.89,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Don’t you need queen status
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.89,0:25:05.76,Default,bir,0,0,0,,and the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.59,0:25:09.93,Default,bir,0,0,0,,You must do what you were born to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.36,0:25:14.80,Default,bir,0,0,0,,As they did in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.11,0:25:23.11,Default,bir,0,0,0,,When they told me that the king was in the well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.65,0:25:31.58,Default,bir,0,0,0,,If you are not fulfilling your role,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.82,0:25:35.22,Default,bir,0,0,0,,the king is useless. From useless
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.15,0:25:37.92,Default,bir,0,0,0,,we need to get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.19,0:25:40.96,Default,bir,0,0,0,,If you harm the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.76,0:25:43.40,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I will not stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.40,0:25:45.66,Default,bir,0,0,0,,So what will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.30,0:25:48.40,Default,bir,0,0,0,,You are very mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.70,0:25:52.37,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Do you think the queen has power?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.90,0:25:58.41,Default,bir,0,0,0,,The queen is needed only to\N produce heirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.11,0:26:02.41,Default,bir,0,0,0,,If you become queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.41,0:26:04.25,Default,bir,0,0,0,,what kind of power do you think you will have
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.35,0:26:08.12,Default,bir,0,0,0,,like a simple woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.50,0:26:55.53,Default,bir,0,0,0,,This is not only because of Kim Jwageun’s words.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.47,0:26:59.77,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Even after staying in the palace for a short time,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.97,0:27:03.68,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I have experienced enough to realize reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.08,0:27:11.88,Default,bir,0,0,0,,The whole palace
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.82,0:27:15.75,Default,bir,0,0,0,,killed Kim So-yeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.92,0:27:24.02,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.99,0:27:27.06,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.59,0:27:29.59,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.53,0:27:35.63,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.17,0:27:39.57,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Queen, what are you doing here so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.67,0:27:44.91,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Why are you soaked through?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.98,0:27:49.41,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Did they really fall into the lake again?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.08,0:27:53.65,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Why do you continue to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.32,0:27:56.89,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Now you need to gather your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.89,0:28:00.59,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Otherwise why have I tried so hard until now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.43,0:28:05.36,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Why did I have to go through such humiliation?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.36,0:28:07.23,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Why do you need this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.23,0:28:10.60,Default,bir,0,0,0,,For their own profit,\N to fill their storages.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.64,0:28:14.51,Default,bir,0,0,0,,You sold your daughter out of greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.17,0:28:17.41,Default,bir,0,0,0,,-Soyeon.\N-Why did they always ask me
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.41,0:28:19.71,Default,bir,0,0,0,,to become a queen, the pride of the family?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.18,0:28:23.11,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Why did they say that when I become queen, I can do whatever I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.85,0:28:26.99,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Why should I, suffering from guilt for the death of my mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.99,0:28:29.99,Default,bir,0,0,0,,did you inspire your dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.72,0:28:35.09,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Do you even know what I was thinking about when I jumped into the lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.89,0:28:38.73,Default,bir,0,0,0,,The life I thought was mine was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.10,0:28:42.57,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Even the dreams were not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.74,0:28:45.80,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I'm a complete loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.51,0:28:50.68,Default,bir,0,0,0,,That’s why I ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.91,0:28:53.95,Default,bir,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.35,0:28:58.15,Default,bir,0,0,0,,The day your dream came true,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.35,0:29:01.95,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I lost the most dear person.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.19,0:29:04.96,Default,bir,0,0,0,,To myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.76,0:29:08.59,Default,bir,0,0,0,,It was you who pushed me into this lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.69,0:29:36.19,Default,bir,0,0,0,,It is convenient for children to blame their parents for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.32,0:29:39.22,Default,bir,0,0,0,,You shouldn’t have blamed your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.64,0:29:54.71,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.38,0:30:06.12,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I have to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.12,0:30:10.46,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I know that you will do everything for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.26,0:30:14.03,Default,bir,0,0,0,,That is, I found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.03,0:30:15.53,Default,bir,0,0,0,,My memories are back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.10,0:30:24.67,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Do nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.24,0:30:28.74,Default,bir,0,0,0,,If you're worried about me, don't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.81,0:30:31.34,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Only this will help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.21,0:30:34.28,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.21,0:30:37.72,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Don’t call me by name.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.85,0:30:40.19,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I'm just
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.22,0:30:43.62,Default,bir,0,0,0,,the queen, whom the Detective Department serves.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.30,0:31:00.74,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Queen's Dictionary
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.72,0:31:14.65,Default,bir,0,0,0,,arrow, lotto, special forces, kitchen police, ramen
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.65,0:31:16.12,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Social distancing
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.13,0:31:27.27,Default,bir,0,0,0,,means every man for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.27,0:31:29.37,Default,beer,0,0,0,,showdown, jasmine tea, bad manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.69,0:31:52.09,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I'll tell the truth, since you can't hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.69,0:31:56.66,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I decided to live a long life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.90,0:32:02.37,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I will betray you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.17,0:32:06.37,Default,bir,0,0,0,,I choose the path that will save my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.81,0:32:10.14,Default,bir,0,0,0,,And don’t die.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.14,0:32:12.91,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Recover as if nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.91,0:32:17.38,Default,bir,0,0,0,,And then I can stab you in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.52,0:32:57.89,Default,bir,0,0,0,,You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.76,0:33:01.09,Default,bir,0,0,0,,The king was stronger than he showed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.09,0:33:03.39,Default,bir,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.39,0:33:05.93,Default,bir,0,0,0,,What do you think about today's case?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.73,0:33:08.90,Default,bir,0,0,0,,We found gunpowder at the explosion site.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.07,0:33:10.70,Default,bir,0,0,0,,-Gunpowder?\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.24,0:33:13.34,Default,bir,0,0,0,,There are two types of gunpowder in Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.54,0:33:15.57,Default,bir,0,0,0,,The one delivered from the Qing Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.01,0:33:18.21,Default,bir,0,0,0,,And local from the gunpowder warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.58,0:33:20.51,Default,bir,0,0,0,,They have a slight difference in structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.75,0:33:24.12,Default,bir,0,0,0,,The one we found is local.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.32,0:33:27.35,Default,zina,0,0,0,,The powder magazine is part of the weapons room.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.69,0:33:31.46,Default,zina,0,0,0,,And the minister of war is in charge of the weapons room.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.36,0:33:34.16,Default,zina,0,0,0,,He is my father's right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.19,0:33:37.46,Default,zina,0,0,0,,This means...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.47,0:33:45.54,Default,zina,0,0,0,,My father was the one who brought the king to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.37,0:33:47.97,Default,zina,0,0,0,,The king showed his true face,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.97,0:33:49.94,Default,zina,0,0,0,,father wants to eliminate him before it becomes his mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.94,0:33:52.74,Default,zina,0,0,0,,and make the guards with fake identities guilty of the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.04,0:33:54.81,Default,zina,0,0,0,,This must be his plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.81,0:33:58.22,Default,zina,0,0,0,,When you came to me the last time,\N you wanted something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.05,0:34:01.72,Default,zina,0,0,0,,So what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.22,0:34:04.09,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I want
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.46,0:34:08.76,Default,zina,0,0,0,,king.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.84,0:34:19.64,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I can’t stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.87,0:34:22.81,Default,zina,0,0,0,,And if that's how you feel, Soyeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.18,0:34:25.28,Default,zina,0,0,0,,this is another reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.07,0:34:50.23,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I came here to tell you about\N what the queen did yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.50,0:34:55.11,Default,zina,0,0,0,,She saved a feast that was about to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.81,0:34:58.41,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Do you think I'll believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.91,0:35:01.05,Default,zina,0,0,0,,You probably think,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.05,0:35:03.18,Default,zina,0,0,0,,it was I who caused the incident with the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.18,0:35:05.25,Default,zina,0,0,0,,If you check, you will easily find the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.88,0:35:09.12,Default,zina,0,0,0,,As I understand, you wanted to ruin the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.45,0:35:11.52,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Even if the queen is deprived of her title...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.52,0:35:13.46,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I don't need any titles.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.03,0:35:18.00,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I just want the queen to disappear from the king's sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.33,0:35:20.60,Default,zina,0,0,0,,This means,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.90,0:35:24.27,Default,zina,0,0,0,,that the king likes the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.94,0:36:39.48,Default,zina,0,0,0,,By the looks of it, you had a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.51,0:36:42.81,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Are you so worried about the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.32,0:36:45.35,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.38,0:36:48.22,Default,zina,0,0,0,,He only recently became your son-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.62,0:36:50.46,Default,zina,0,0,0,,You seem to have become attached to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.66,0:36:51.72,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.13,0:36:55.23,Default,zina,0,0,0,,to be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.96,0:36:59.26,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I did something that will dishonor our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.63,0:37:03.47,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I kept records of the illegally acquired property of our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.10,0:37:06.64,Default,zina,0,0,0,,And I lost them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.27,0:37:08.34,Default,zina,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.34,0:37:10.14,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I found out where the book is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.51,0:37:12.71,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I just need to find her and get rid of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.61,0:37:16.61,Default,zina,0,0,0,,But I ask you to spare the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.92,0:37:20.28,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Why did you suddenly mention it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.28,0:37:21.62,Default,zina,0,0,0,,The person who now has a book,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.22,0:37:24.49,Default,zina,0,0,0,,this is the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.42,0:37:29.33,Default,zina,0,0,0,,The Queen has nothing\N to do with this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.69,0:37:33.06,Default,zina,0,0,0,,The king misled her and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.97,0:37:38.54,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Yes, he misled everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.77,0:37:42.01,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I will accept any of your punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.11,0:37:44.18,Default,zina,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.31,0:37:47.65,Default,zina,0,0,0,,have mercy Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.11,0:37:51.02,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Spare the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.12,0:37:54.99,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I beg you, spare the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.06,0:38:00.12,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.33,0:38:07.53,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Did you sleep in the Detective Department?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.53,0:38:11.14,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Yes. This is a big deal, I have a lot of work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.74,0:38:15.44,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Everything in the case points to me as a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.11,0:38:18.24,Default,zina,0,0,0,,But you didn’t talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.04,0:38:20.31,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.15,0:38:23.55,Default,zina,0,0,0,,The detective department has taken up the investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.55,0:38:25.22,Default,zina,0,0,0,,If you have been slandered,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.58,0:38:27.99,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I will reveal the real culprit of this incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.62,0:38:30.02,Default,zina,0,0,0,,This is calming.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.72,0:38:33.16,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Recently
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.46,0:38:37.20,Default,zina,0,0,0,,you said that you have decided\N the scale of your dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.46,0:38:41.00,Default,zina,0,0,0,,So how big is your dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.27,0:38:44.87,Default,zina,0,0,0,,My dream -
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.34,0:38:48.94,Default,zina,0,0,0,,become at least half as successful as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.38,0:38:57.58,Default,zina,0,0,0,,It’s too late. Rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.91,0:39:21.97,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Don’t come near.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.51,0:39:24.04,Default,zina,0,0,0,,If you follow me, I will kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.65,0:39:29.68,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.59,0:39:46.46,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I know what motivates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.83,0:40:18.06,Default,zina,0,0,0,,So where is the queen early in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.30,0:40:19.83,Default,zina,0,0,0,,She is in the royal kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.33,0:40:21.43,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.60,0:40:23.60,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.34,0:40:27.20,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I wanted her to prepare breakfast for me when she woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.47,0:40:30.21,Default,zina,0,0,0,,And she’s already cooking for her granny, that’s how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.50,0:40:52.70,Default,zina,0,0,0,,That scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.93,0:40:55.67,Default,zina,0,0,0,,It’s too early. What are you cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.90,0:40:58.50,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I've been so depressed lately.\N And I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.67,0:41:00.64,Default,zina,0,0,0,,As if I were saying my morning prayer,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.64,0:41:02.27,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I'm making a very annoying dish,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.27,0:41:04.61,Default,zin,0,0,0,,which needs to be crushed and mixed a million times.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.68,0:41:08.11,Default,zina,0,0,0,,But the rice porridge looks somehow strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.11,0:41:10.92,Default,zina,0,0,0,,This is not rice porridge. This is potage.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.28,0:41:12.85,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Tongue slurred? It's still early.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.85,0:41:15.15,Default,zina,0,0,0,,This means “carrot porridge.”
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.42,0:41:18.22,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Wait, I need to write it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.79,0:41:20.93,Default,zina,0,0,0,,And how to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.03,0:41:25.26,Default,zina,0,0,0,,You need to chop the onions and carrots and cook for an hour in water.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.26,0:41:26.93,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Then grind in a mortar.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.93,0:41:29.23,Default,zina,0,0,0,,As if you are crushing all\N experiences and illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.77,0:41:33.47,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Then stir over low heat so that it doesn’t burn and there are no clots.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.47,0:41:35.14,Default,zina,0,0,0,,With a sense of self-improvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.91,0:41:38.11,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Season with salt
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.14,0:41:41.98,Default,zina,0,0,0,,and add a little milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.98,0:41:43.41,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Even milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.51,0:41:45.02,Default,zina,0,0,0,,That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.22,0:41:46.32,Default,zina,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.78,0:41:50.82,Default,zina,0,0,0,,You need to prepare vegetable soup in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.19,0:41:52.59,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Take the broth
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.56,0:41:56.53,Default,zina,0,0,0,,and add a little to the porridge for a rich taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.66,0:41:59.16,Default,zina,0,0,0,,You need to be so confused just to add a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.16,0:42:02.10,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Told you so. It's like morning prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.90,0:42:07.14,Default,zina,0,0,0,,You put your heart and soul into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.14,0:42:10.74,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I’m sure the king will immediately come to his senses as soon as he tries.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.84,0:42:12.88,Default,zina,0,0,0,,This is not for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.01,0:42:18.88,Default,zina,0,0,0,,What to suffer twice, I’ll figure it out in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.25,0:42:21.69,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Because I told her something last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.72,0:42:25.36,Default,zina,0,0,0,,forces me to have meals with my mother-in-law?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.19,0:42:30.09,Default,zina,0,0,0,,She dared to say with her wayward mouth that I am old,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.36,0:42:32.26,Default,zina,0,0,0,,should I look at her in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.64,0:42:40.27,Default,zina,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.27,0:42:41.84,Default,zina,0,0,0,,This is brunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.41,0:42:43.81,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Brunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.97,0:42:46.14,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Means “women meet together.”
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.38,0:42:48.55,Default,zina,0,0,0,,This is the time when women gather for breakfast
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.55,0:42:50.65,Default,zina,0,0,0,,and get closer to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.95,0:42:53.75,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Everyone knows what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.75,0:42:55.52,Default,zina,0,0,0,,It’s like you’re not from Gojoseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.59,0:42:56.69,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.86,0:43:00.79,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I used to do this quite often at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.19,0:43:02.46,Default,zina,0,0,0,,It was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.36,0:43:04.63,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.47,0:43:09.57,Default,zina,0,0,0,,This is carrot porridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.83,0:43:12.37,Default,zina,0,0,0,,It contains many products that\N will help improve vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.37,0:43:13.44,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.14,0:43:15.81,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Queen Mother, eat more.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.81,0:43:18.18,Default,zina,0,0,0,,It seems that you have become blind lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.18,0:43:22.21,Default,zina,0,0,0,,If that’s the case, then I think the queen needs to eat everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.45,0:43:25.08,Default,zina,0,0,0,,What the? Why are they so cocky?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.46,0:43:34.89,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Very tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.23,0:43:42.73,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.17,0:43:45.70,Default,zina,0,0,0,,From now on
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.70,0:43:48.24,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I will make sure that\Nwe get together more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.24,0:43:50.41,Default,zina,0,0,0,,-Bastard.\N-What a bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.47,0:43:52.48,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Then I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.61,0:43:56.28,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I'll bring you drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.16,0:44:09.53,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Rumors about the queen's culinary skills are a bit exaggerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.83,0:44:12.93,Default,zina,0,0,0,,The ability to recognize good food is a component of nobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.53,0:44:18.10,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Are you letting the queen get away with everything\N just for this talent?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.10,0:44:21.01,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Since it was you who conveyed to me the words of the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.57,0:44:23.27,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.68,0:44:28.75,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Of course you won’t believe what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.05,0:44:31.72,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I heard the king and queen
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.42,0:44:35.22,Default,zina,0,0,0,,we secretly exchanged notes all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.62,0:44:39.09,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I wonder what they wrote to each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.89,0:44:43.86,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I'll bring your drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.77,0:44:54.51,Default,zina,0,0,0,,This is a drink made from wine and various fruits,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.51,0:44:57.68,Default,zina,0,0,0,,boiled with anise and cinnamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.58,0:45:00.38,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Wine in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.41,0:45:02.01,Default,zina,0,0,0,,All alcohol has evaporated,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.01,0:45:04.85,Default,zina,0,0,0,,there are only products left that help maintain youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.45,0:45:09.02,Default,zina,0,0,0,,This is more of a medicine than a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.99,0:45:19.13,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I can’t believe you thought of making wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.60,0:45:22.50,Default,zina,0,0,0,,How did you come up with this idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.83,0:45:27.07,Default,zina,0,0,0,,Where do you get inspiration for your dishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.07,0:45:31.38,Default,zina,0,0,0,,I don’t know whether to call it inspiration or creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.38,0:45:34.45,Default,zina,0,0,0,,When I see the ingredients, I immediately think about
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.45,0:45:36.01,Default,zina,0,0,0,,how to preserve their original taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.45,0:45:38.88,Default,zina,0,0,0,,In these times they were wary of the West,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.88,0:45:40.65,Default,zina,0,0,0,,so I won’t say that this is French cuisine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.92,0:45:47.93,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.90,0:45:55.43,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Hello, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.90,0:45:59.74,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I was waiting for you to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.74,0:46:02.74,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,What? What do you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.74,0:46:05.01,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,After the incident with the king
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.74,0:46:07.54,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I was overcome by different thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.15,0:46:11.32,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,No one knows what will happen next,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.88,0:46:14.75,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,and tomorrow may be the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.95,0:46:18.12,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,If my life ends tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.36,0:46:21.63,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,what will I regret most?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.89,0:46:25.13,Default,tira,0,0,0,,About feelings that I could not express,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.70,0:46:27.16,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,because I doubted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.53,0:46:28.87,Default,tira,0,0,0,,One sincere word
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.37,0:46:31.50,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,better than any sophisticated confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.70,0:46:34.87,Default,dash,0,0,0,,Therefore
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.81,0:46:39.31,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I want to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.61,0:46:41.75,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,that I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.49,0:46:53.06,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I don’t like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.49,0:46:54.53,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.59,0:46:56.79,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,About gunpowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.39,0:46:59.50,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Amount of gunpowder produced in the south
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.50,0:47:00.76,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Gyeongsang Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.10,0:47:03.73,Default,dash,0,0,0,,and the quantity arriving at the warehouse are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.17,0:47:06.47,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.11,0:47:13.94,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Is the king still unconscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.48,0:47:15.55,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.21,0:47:19.32,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I heard he lost his hearing. This will be a problem in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.95,0:47:25.12,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,About this incident with the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.72,0:47:27.83,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,For an explosion of this magnitude
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.16,0:47:30.83,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,used gunpowder?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.76,0:47:32.83,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.26,0:47:36.93,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,It could be sulfur or explosive gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.63,0:47:39.57,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,If it were sulfur, there would be a smell,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.57,0:47:41.51,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,so the king would notice him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.61,0:47:43.61,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,If it were gas, it would be difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.61,0:47:46.18,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,prevent it from leaking and blow it all up at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.28,0:47:48.95,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,The culprits are interrogated, but they do not confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.95,0:47:50.48,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,It's hard to find out who is behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.75,0:48:24.72,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,When I see the ingredients, I immediately think about
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.72,0:48:26.55,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,how to preserve their original taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.79,0:48:31.22,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Cannot be.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.72,0:48:33.82,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Guilty of treason
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.82,0:48:35.89,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,revealed the leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.69,0:48:39.96,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Looks like low-ranking guards\N opposing the Royal Court,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.96,0:48:41.93,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,got together and caused an explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.97,0:48:43.07,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.63,0:48:46.97,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,You say no one is behind them?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.70,0:48:50.41,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,In such a big matter as the murder of a king?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.41,0:48:51.78,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,This is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.38,0:48:55.48,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,We should fear most those who have nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.48,0:48:57.71,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Probably they believed\Nthat they could not rise higher,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.71,0:48:59.98,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,so we decided to radically change the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.98,0:49:01.69,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Probably this is the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.82,0:49:05.79,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,That makes sense. Act of treason for the purpose of enthronement
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.79,0:49:08.89,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,the king's half-brother, Lee Wong-gyong,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.89,0:49:11.36,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,also committed by low-ranking guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.36,0:49:14.20,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Considering that the king is unconscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.20,0:49:16.73,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,the longer we delay with this, the more confusion there will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.83,0:49:17.97,Default,dash,0,0,0,,Therefore
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.34,0:49:21.24,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,seven culprits will take full responsibility
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.41,0:49:26.11,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,and will be sentenced to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.45,0:49:37.72,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,For attempting to assassinate the king\Nand plotting treason
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.19,0:49:40.96,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,you are sentenced to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.56,0:49:44.53,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Do you have the last word?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.70,0:49:51.97,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,If you sentence them to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.34,0:49:55.37,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,you will never know who was behind all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.87,0:49:58.08,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,They said that no one was behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.91,0:50:00.24,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,This is a reckless decision...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.24,0:50:03.65,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,This decision was made after a night of investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.08,0:50:07.25,Default,dash,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.84,0:51:03.91,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Decapitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.84,0:51:06.84,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.22,0:51:16.65,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,The investigation was carried out\N by royal order.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.22,0:51:18.92,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Are you going to interrupt us?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.12,0:51:21.39,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Release the innocent immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.43,0:51:25.03,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,This is a real order.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.84,0:51:36.97,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.67,0:51:38.71,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.78,0:51:45.98,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I heard you were unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.32,0:51:48.99,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I am young and full of strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.35,0:51:50.99,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,so it quickly recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.23,0:51:57.49,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I didn’t want to lie there in vain
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.49,0:51:59.53,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,and recover in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.76,0:52:01.13,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,So I was looking for those
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.13,0:52:03.83,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,who plotted to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.30,0:52:08.07,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,First I found out about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.64,0:52:12.64,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Do you want to say that you checked us?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.21,0:52:15.28,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Someone is planning treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.25,0:52:18.32,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Say that your personal life is more important,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.38,0:52:23.45,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,than the life of a king?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.39,0:52:26.49,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,No, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.33,0:52:31.16,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,If you have nothing to hide, then there is nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.00,0:52:36.33,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.50,0:52:39.70,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,I found the leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.94,0:52:42.57,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,-What is he talking about?\N-What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.01,0:52:50.51,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,In the bakhurnitsa used in the ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.11,0:52:53.55,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,gunpowder was found, in large quantities.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.82,0:52:56.39,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,-Gunpowder?\N-Gunpowder?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.26,0:53:00.32,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Large quantity?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.16,0:53:08.63,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Mellow will become a huge bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.03,0:53:11.67,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,-This is too dangerous.\N-Everything has already been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.10,0:53:14.04,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Tracking the origins of gunpowder,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.67,0:53:16.31,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I received information,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.31,0:53:19.88,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,that this gunpowder\N is unofficially traded in the port of Tonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.05,0:53:29.25,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,By the way, why do you need so much gunpowder?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.45,0:53:33.22,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,To attack Joseon again a little later.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.86,0:53:38.13,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.93,0:53:40.73,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,-Thank you?\N-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.53,0:53:44.73,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,-Thank you.\N-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.57,0:53:47.87,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.54,0:53:51.21,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Where did this gunpowder come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.54,0:53:53.41,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,It is produced only for military purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.41,0:53:56.18,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,It cannot in any way be produced for personal use,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.55,0:53:58.68,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,after all, this is a dangerous and valuable product.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.22,0:54:04.29,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,So, I looked at all the places where gunpowder is made in Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.96,0:54:06.72,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,And I discovered something strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.33,0:54:10.86,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,In certain areas in production areas
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.86,0:54:15.23,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,were constantly pocketing some amount of gunpowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.57,0:54:19.64,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Amount of concealed gunpowder
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.64,0:54:23.41,Default,dash,0,0,0,,was small at first, but grew over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.77,0:54:24.84,Default,dash,0,0,0,,Direct
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.08,0:54:28.04,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,how greed grows.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.35,0:54:31.28,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,-What?\N-Is this true?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.58,0:54:35.25,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,You know, when the theft of gunpowder began,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.02,0:54:37.55,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,troop commander Kim Jwageun?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.56,0:54:46.23,Default,dash,0,0,0,,The same year that I ascended the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.93,0:54:52.10,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,In the same year, Mr. Kim Jwageun became the commander of the troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.70,0:54:56.04,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, this is a false accusation.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.04,0:54:57.44,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.24,0:55:01.01,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Minister of War, responsible for the production of gunpowder,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.01,0:55:04.45,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,also a traitor, plotting treason with Kim Jwageun!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.58,0:55:08.05,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I'm using the royal guard's fake identities as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.32,0:55:12.09,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Kim Jwageun should have already found out about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.56,0:55:19.93,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,You will go through unbearable torture,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.33,0:55:21.63,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,but bear with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.67,0:55:25.14,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I will definitely save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.64,0:55:35.25,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,This is a false accusation,\Nunderstand this, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.95,0:55:41.58,Default,dash,0,0,0,,If you say again that you are being falsely accused,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.02,0:55:45.42,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I will immediately give you poison to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.96,0:55:51.96,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Gunpowder merchants sold it
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.96,0:55:54.03,Default,dash,0,0,0,,anyone who paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.23,0:55:56.97,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Bandits, even the Japanese!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.17,0:56:00.24,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,If this is not for the sake of the destruction of Joseon, then for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.20,0:56:04.11,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Who else was here with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.39,0:56:17.25,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Troop commander Kim Jwageun.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.79,0:56:20.09,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Minister of War Kim Chang-hyuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.42,0:56:22.69,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,These two
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.99,0:56:27.06,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,stole national weapons to weaken the army,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.63,0:56:31.77,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,and planned an assassination attempt on me, the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.50,0:56:35.91,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,which means they are guilty of treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.67,0:56:39.88,Default,dash,0,0,0,,What should we call this operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.98,0:56:42.98,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.72,0:56:47.28,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Operation name -
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.42,0:56:50.42,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,burning Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.43,0:56:57.33,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,For all crimes
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.93,0:57:01.00,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,the perpetrators will be dismissed from office
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.53,0:57:04.00,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,and exiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.97,0:57:07.04,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.27,0:57:14.11,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,-The Dowager Queen.\N-The Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.54,0:57:16.51,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.98,0:57:18.72,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Why do you judge without reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.15,0:57:21.82,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,You must have lost your mind after the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.42,0:57:25.05,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Remember the limits of what is permitted!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.72,0:57:26.92,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.63,0:57:30.36,Default,dash,0,0,0,,If you say so,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.60,0:57:42.31,Default,dash,0,0,0,,you must have lost your mind due to old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.67,0:57:48.55,Default,dash,0,0,0,,I cannot continue discussing political issues while you are in this state.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.61,0:57:52.92,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,Please leave your regency.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.05,0:57:56.39,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,-What?\N-What is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.86,0:58:02.86,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,It’s time for me to make my own decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.43,0:58:04.59,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.59,0:58:07.70,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I should have immediately given Kim Jwageun the poison to drink
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.70,0:58:09.50,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,and execute his entire family.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.73,0:58:12.27,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,But because of you and the queen
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.04,0:58:15.31,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I decided to just deprive him of the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.67,0:58:17.84,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,You don’t like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.31,0:58:22.75,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Are you trying to make a deal with me in exchange for my brother's life?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.25,0:58:26.62,Default,dash,0,0,0,,You can only call it a deal if you have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.32,0:58:31.39,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.96,0:58:37.09,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I, Kim Jwageun, have been falsely accused,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.33,0:58:38.73,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,but I will prove my loyalty,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.73,0:58:41.13,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,obeying the royal order.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.60,0:58:42.93,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.57,0:58:46.77,Default,dash,0,0,0,,I was afraid that because of your old age, you might be consumed by greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.97,0:58:48.84,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I am not against removal from office.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.07,0:58:51.34,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,But I ask you to give me the opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.34,0:58:53.81,Default,dash,0,0,0,,clear your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.11,0:58:56.61,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I ask Sakhonbu to be removed from his position.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.01,0:58:59.08,Default,dash,0,0,0,,I accept your request.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.38,0:59:04.02,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,But if Sakhonbu does not remove him from office by tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.35,0:59:07.99,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I will immediately remove the commander of the troops, Kim Jwageun, from his position
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.56,0:59:11.33,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,and I will dissolve not only Sakhonbu himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.33,0:59:14.73,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,but also all the officials present!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.40,0:59:19.90,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,-We ask for your mercy!\N-We ask for your mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.72,0:59:38.32,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,You lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.72,0:59:41.69,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,You were kicked out by the king to whom you yourself gave the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.09,0:59:45.19,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I did not know that the king would plan his own assassination attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.80,0:59:48.73,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Who do you think set the trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.27,0:59:52.74,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,I entrusted you with the selection of noblewomen.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.10,0:59:55.57,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,But you don’t understand people well.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.87,1:00:01.71,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,Confucius said that the heart is more complex than nature,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.81,1:00:04.65,Default,dash,0,0,0,,and seeing someone else’s heart is more difficult than seeing what’s behind the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.21,1:00:06.58,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,I made a mistake in selecting noblewomen
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.58,1:00:08.72,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,both in the palace and outside it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.89,1:00:12.76,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,You also trusted the queen
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.76,1:00:15.16,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,take care of choosing royal concubines.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.76,1:00:18.43,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,But she made a choice in favor of the king.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.66,1:00:20.93,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,And it was the queen who saved the feast,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.93,1:00:22.40,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,that I ruined.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.93,1:00:27.34,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,The enemy is terrible when he is among his own.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.05,1:00:41.12,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.36,1:00:51.09,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,His Majesty must have regained consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.46,1:00:57.10,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I can keep an eye on my husband\N when he regains consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.77,1:01:00.94,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,If he doesn’t wake up, I will become useless.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.50,1:01:04.27,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,If I become useless, I will be overthrown.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.27,1:01:06.78,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,If I am overthrown, I will give up thoughts of revenge
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.78,1:01:09.25,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,and I’ll open a restaurant to make a living.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.78,1:01:12.58,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.02,1:01:14.05,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Queen!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.25,1:01:18.32,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,His Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.52,1:01:23.26,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,He regained consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.86,1:01:25.03,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.03,1:01:27.33,Default,dash,0,0,0,,Yes. His hearing has returned
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.33,1:01:29.47,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,and he went to the royal council.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.47,1:01:31.67,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,I was really scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.37,1:01:33.60,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.54,1:01:36.84,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.94,1:01:40.21,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I don’t have time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.21,1:01:46.78,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.25,1:01:49.65,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.69,1:01:53.46,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Really, I’m very glad.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.36,1:02:01.80,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Don’t cry. Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.27,1:02:03.80,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,This is such a relief.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.80,1:02:05.60,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.17,1:02:11.94,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,-I will do it.\N-Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.98,1:02:19.15,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.35,1:02:25.82,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Everything is fine now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.76,1:02:29.79,Default,dash,0,0,0,,Everything is fine, because you are awake and healthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.49,1:02:35.57,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I will never lose you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.53,1:02:38.57,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.47,1:02:43.01,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Queen's Dictionary
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.25,1:02:51.35,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.35,1:02:54.42,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,They said that you would visit the king. Why are you sitting here?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.98,1:02:56.22,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Another glass.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.69,1:02:59.92,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,It’s somehow awkward to see him sober.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.02,1:03:05.03,Default,dash,0,0,0,,Stop drinking. You don't have to do this, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.03,1:03:07.66,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Enough work for you. Go home!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.07,1:03:13.37,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I'll drink this to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.44,1:03:16.94,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.84,1:03:19.28,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.65,1:03:26.15,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,In the royal kitchen, the supply of alcohol is unlimited.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.12,1:03:31.15,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Why are you embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.46,1:03:35.59,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Awkward because...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.29,1:03:40.93,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,You're right. Why is this awkward?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.13,1:03:44.40,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I'm confident! Let's go to the king.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.67,1:03:46.84,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,You can’t go now,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.84,1:03:48.50,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,go when you sober up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.57,1:03:50.87,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's go tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.21,1:03:52.44,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Let's put this off until tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.44,1:03:53.64,Default,dash,0,0,0,,Just like going on a diet.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.88,1:03:55.81,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,We have tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.35,1:03:58.65,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Royal chef. Another bottle.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.55,1:04:01.92,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Does she think she came to the tavern or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.75,1:04:04.79,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.96,1:04:43.09,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Court lady Kan.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.73,1:04:48.90,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Secret
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.90,1:04:50.00,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.50,1:04:55.54,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.76,1:05:18.23,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,This was found in the Daejojon hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.23,1:05:21.36,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,As expected, the king and queen are working together.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.36,1:05:24.37,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,The Queen is completely broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.33,1:05:28.87,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Broken things need to be replaced with new ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.81,1:05:34.21,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,But you can make a broken thing last until the end
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.78,1:05:37.91,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,and send it to the fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.58,1:05:42.35,Default,dash,0,0,0,,Maybe we use real arsenic?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.76,1:05:52.36,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,The Queen loves to eat so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.96,1:05:55.46,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,So let's set the table for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.73,1:05:59.34,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Are you going to leave the king?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.70,1:06:03.51,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,We have to break it\N in order to continue using it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.97,1:06:08.54,Default,dash,0,0,0,,If this happens, as soon as he\N gives his heart to the queen, he will understand,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.11,1:06:11.68,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,that everyone on his side will become unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.06,1:07:00.56,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Isn’t it a miracle,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.23,1:07:04.50,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,what tomorrow comes every day?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.91,1:07:14.14,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Let's go to the second round in the Songjeongjong hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.51,1:07:17.98,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,We need to celebrate the king’s recovery.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.98,1:07:20.78,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Please don’t shout, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.78,1:07:22.42,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.92,1:07:24.65,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.65,1:07:27.72,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,You can’t call him that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.46,1:07:30.66,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.36,1:07:35.56,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.34,1:07:45.27,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Spiral Potatoes
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.48,1:07:53.28,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Are you sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.84,1:08:15.81,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I think I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.04,1:08:24.45,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Were you looking after me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.52,1:08:28.92,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Why do you keep doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.12,1:08:34.12,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Worrying about me, trying to understand me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.03,1:08:39.86,Default,dash,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, you're the first person I saw when I came here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.13,1:08:46.77,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I owe you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.20,1:08:50.94,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I thought about you when I tried to leave the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.54,1:08:54.68,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I thought I would never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.35,1:09:36.22,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,Hon Young.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.21,1:09:59.64,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.82,1:10:13.66,Default,dash,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.97,1:10:31.14,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,I am sure that the soul of this woman has taken possession of my body.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.14,1:10:33.14,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Why do you constantly avoid me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.14,1:10:35.21,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,-Wait.\N-What did he want to ask me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.21,1:10:36.25,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Did you like it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.25,1:10:38.15,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Didn’t you say that this is prohibited?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.15,1:10:40.22,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,She said that hugging, smiling and lying next to you -
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.22,1:10:41.88,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,all this is prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.25,1:10:44.02,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I forbid you to say that this is prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.39,1:10:45.75,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,I have prepared everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.75,1:10:46.86,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.86,1:10:49.26,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Someone will die in the palace today.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.26,1:10:50.73,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I can’t believe they tried to get rid of the queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.73,1:10:55.26,Default,dash,0,0,0,,I specially prepared ice, which is more expensive than gold today.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.26,1:10:56.87,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,

Comment: 0,0:12:33.43,0:12:34.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lord.
